{"4026690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spray N' Pray", "steam_appid": 4026690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>**A student team project designed to deliver a ~10 minute experience.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spray N' Pray</strong> is a fast-paced first-person boomer shooter where you play as Justinian, a priest chosen by God to purge the Earth of demons, hellspawn, and fallen angels. The cathedral is overrun, and only your faith, speed, and firepower can cleanse it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/1bc8b72f088ce8dab994af61ce9d53f3.poster.avif?t=1760642033\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/1bc8b72f088ce8dab994af61ce9d53f3.webm?t=1760642033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/1bc8b72f088ce8dab994af61ce9d53f3.mp4?t=1760642033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with your signature dual revolvers, you’ll unleash a storm of righteous bullets while mastering smooth movement; dash, run, and melee-strikes that close the distance between you and your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/ba6ef01b9703e1c1ed84a7999c383da4.poster.avif?t=1760642033\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/ba6ef01b9703e1c1ed84a7999c383da4.webm?t=1760642033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/ba6ef01b9703e1c1ed84a7999c383da4.mp4?t=1760642033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your ultimate power by merging your revolvers into one divine weapon, unleashing a blistering hail of bullets. And when demons close the gap, crush them with a brutal melee strike to break their ranks. With every kill, you climb closer to your holy reckoning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/bc424c2705ef066c0746eba12c04661c.poster.avif?t=1760642033\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/bc424c2705ef066c0746eba12c04661c.webm?t=1760642033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/bc424c2705ef066c0746eba12c04661c.mp4?t=1760642033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>**A student team project designed to deliver a ~10 minute experience.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spray N' Pray</strong> is a fast-paced first-person boomer shooter where you play as Justinian, a priest chosen by God to purge the Earth of demons, hellspawn, and fallen angels. The cathedral is overrun, and only your faith, speed, and firepower can cleanse it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/1bc8b72f088ce8dab994af61ce9d53f3.poster.avif?t=1760642033\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/1bc8b72f088ce8dab994af61ce9d53f3.webm?t=1760642033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/1bc8b72f088ce8dab994af61ce9d53f3.mp4?t=1760642033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with your signature dual revolvers, you’ll unleash a storm of righteous bullets while mastering smooth movement; dash, run, and melee-strikes that close the distance between you and your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/ba6ef01b9703e1c1ed84a7999c383da4.poster.avif?t=1760642033\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/ba6ef01b9703e1c1ed84a7999c383da4.webm?t=1760642033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/ba6ef01b9703e1c1ed84a7999c383da4.mp4?t=1760642033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your ultimate power by merging your revolvers into one divine weapon, unleashing a blistering hail of bullets. And when demons close the gap, crush them with a brutal melee strike to break their ranks. With every kill, you climb closer to your holy reckoning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/bc424c2705ef066c0746eba12c04661c.poster.avif?t=1760642033\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/bc424c2705ef066c0746eba12c04661c.webm?t=1760642033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/extras/bc424c2705ef066c0746eba12c04661c.mp4?t=1760642033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Spray N' Pray is a fast-paced boomer shooter where you play as Justinian, a priest armed with dual revolvers. Dash, run, and jump through a demon-infested cathedral, vanquishing hellspawn and fallen angels to earn your righteous place in heaven.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/1d42f3337eab7ef2ccc405824903bd594673e956/header.jpg?t=1760642033", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/c3dfed57187182f7ec71f2fa675621c6cfba2ece/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760642033", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026690/c3dfed57187182f7ec71f2fa675621c6cfba2ece/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760642033", "website": "https://vfs.edu/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5 3.0GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 TI or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i7 3.4GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> VIDIA Quadro RTX 5000 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "ma